{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1030741-supernatural-thermodynamics-just-for-fun","id":1030741,"title":"Supernatural Thermodynamics [Just For Fun!]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-12T13:06:46-08:00","id":1030741,"title":"Supernatural Thermodynamics [Just For Fun!]","content":"because who has said that you can't use science to explain things in CofD? :P<br /> <br /> (note- as people may expect, this is not going to be 100% accurate, scientific speaking, but it is still fun. I blame my statistical thermodynamics professor for this :P).<br /> <br /> <b><u>From the Thesis of Norman McFarland, scientist of the Null Mysteries</u></b><br /> <br /> Thermodynamics is a science studying the transference and conversion of different forms of energy into work. Supernatural Thermodynamics, in that case, is used in order to explain the so called form of &quot;Supernatural Energy&quot;- that is, energy as been conserved through a supernatural medium, such as supernatural beings. My study, however, has showed that the very term &quot;Supernatural Energy&quot; could be quit misleading, as different supernatural beings do not conserve or convert energy in the same manner. In fact, it has been shown that in order to fully understand the nature of Supernatural Thermodynamics, we have to define a new set of dimensions and units of measurements, parallel to the more standard model as used to the research of the natural world.<br /> <br /> First, before we could start investigate the nature of Supernatural Energy, we need to define the meaning of energy- a complicate subject by itself. For the purpose of this article, we shall define energy as movement or the potential for movement. We shall divide the forms of supernatural energy into two categories- potential energy (meaning, the energy the object may use to move) and kinetic energy (the energy invested in the movement of the item, which could be represented as Ek = m(v^2)/2 ). Transference of energy into the surroundings could through two ways- Work (or transference of energy required to preform a process) and Dissipation (the amount of energy &quot;lost&quot; to the surroundings). The total amount of energy in a system could be defined through the energy conserved in its dimensions and the appropriate variable which defined the amount of energy in that dimension. Each such pair of variables should be called Conjugated Variable, when one is called an &quot;extensive variable&quot; (that is, one which grows linearly by adding another system) and an &quot;intensive variable&quot; (that is, one which does not depends on the size of the system). Generally, the variable representing the dimension should be the extensive variable and the one defining the partition of energy would be the intensive one. Examples for such variable would be volume and pressure, electric charge and voltage or entropy and temperature.<br /> <br /> Now, after that sort introduction, we can start defining the forms of Supernatural Energy. First, we shall investigate the most common forms of supernatural beings, usually known as &quot;Ephemeral Beings&quot;. That vast category covers, in fact, a great number of different phenomena, from the restless shades of the dead and primal animistic representation to bio-mechanical creations and mental constructs. Considering the vastness of this category, we shall first focus around the first two kinds of beings- most commonly known as &quot;ghosts&quot; and &quot;spirits&quot;.<br /> <br /> While the very basic nature of either of those beings is quit different, my research has shown that the two do share certain common features in terms of Supernatural Thermodynamics. While one is based around the residual presence of a soul and the other is formed from coalescence of primal energy of the world, the mechanism behind them is quit similar. Through investigation of previous texts and articles about the subject, we can deduct that both of those beings require a substance known as &quot;Essence&quot;, which we shall now define as the appropriate dimension (that is, the Essential Dimension)- which means we shall refer to Essence as the extensive variable. According to the occultists, the amount of power such being has is called &quot;Rank&quot;. While it saddens me to use such a non-scientific term, in order to avoid future confusion with related articles we shall refer to Rank as the conjugated, intensive variable, with units of [energy/essence].<br /> <br /> If we assume that energy is uniformly distributed in the Essential Dimension (that is, that each Essence in the universe holds the same amount of energy), we could calculate the value of Rank in [kJ/esse]. Experimental measurements shows that the most simple of Ephemeral Beings have a Rank value of 10 kJ/esse, while the most powerful ones recorded may reach 50 kJ/esse. The progression in power, while seems linear at the beginning, change its trend starts sharply around the middle of its power. That level of change corresponds to a change in the phase of the system, indicating that once the Rank of the being reaches the 50 kJ/esse limit something fundamental change in the structure of the system, moving it into a new state (perhaps even on the quantum level).<br /> <br /> It should be noted that those results must be taken with cautions- for the lack of accessible ghosts with a Rank value of more than 15 kJ/esse and the inability to to preform frequent experiments upon high Rank spirits proves to be problematic at best.<br /> <br /> As it was mentioned in the last paragraph, no ghost may exist spontaneously (meaning, without preforming Work) in the material world with a Rank of more than 15 kJ/esse. That shows that this state of system in incredibly unstable, and that the Rank value of ghosts cause further instability in the universe. In order to balance that disruption in potential, the ghost is moved a tangent system to the material world- that is, the Underworld- which returns the world into an equilibrium. Spirits, on the other hand, do not suffer from such instability, which means two things- first, the Rank value of spirits is different from the one of ghosts, and as such is defined through a different Essential Dimension (meaning, spiritual Essence is different than macabre Essence, although the two are quit similar from the outside). Second, the universe has an higher spiritual Rank than macabre one, allowing it contain more powerful spirits. That shows that while ghosts look more &quot;human like&quot; than spirits, spirits are more integral to the world than ghosts- which may rise interesting questions about the place of humanity in the world.<br /> <br /> Anyway, enough philosophy. Returning to the subject, Both spirits and ghosts seem to exist in the material world in a new state of matter called &quot;Twilight&quot;- which seems to be an high-energy phase in which interactions between them and the physical are negligible. Changing from a Twilight state of matter into a physical one is called Manifestation. Such process usually require a transmission of energy to the environment in the form of Essence, making them into exothermic processes. Some create weak only weak interactions with the material world, such as creating an image (amount of energy released in the process, or enthalpy, is around 1 kJ/esse) while others create some powerful, and sometimes irreversible interactions similar to covalent bonds (enthalpy of around 5 kJ/esse). Certain interactions are unique to certain ephemeral being types, further indicating that the general division of such beings is misleading and may cause scientific miscalculations, as both are actually different systems.<br /> <br /> Now, let us investigate the nature of Essence as a dimension. First, all ephemeral beings seem to naturally lose Essence to the world through Dissipation. That further support the claim that the natural world has a low Rank value comparing to such beings. It further makes the case for the spiritual stability interesting, as it suggests that both the spiritual and the macabre Rank values are of the same size- but perhaps the Shadow (as the spirit world is called) simply has greater congruence with the material world than the Underworld has, allowing spiritual Essence to flow better than the macabre type. Such dissipation is hasten while the being is found in a more energetic state of matter- for such state in unstable and the universe moves the system back to equilibrium. It should be noted that in order to truly destroy an ephemeral being, it must lack all of its Essence- meaning that Essence is a form of movement which allows existence, similar to chemical potential. Such beings may also use Essence in order to strength themselves, reinforcing their very existence into the world. Through that interpretation, it can be deducted that the reason ghosts are forced into the Underworld at higher Ranks is simply that the world does not contain enough &quot;macabric existence&quot;, making that state unstable. In sort, the world is alive, and as no place for the dead.<br /> <br /> Still, those dimensions does exist in the world around us- macabre Essence seem to be generated around ghostly anchors, that is places which reinforce the existence of the shade, and once someone is reminded of them. That notion reinforce the idea of &quot;Essence as level of existence&quot; and a proof that the world may convert non supernatural energy into a supernatural one. Spirits, however, reinforce themselves through appropriate sources of existence and actually have to take that energy by force from the world. That may hint that while spiritual Essence is a natural part of the universe, spirits are not, as unlike ghosts they lack direct interaction with the source of their Essence.<br /> <br /> Other than the basic functions of the systems, ghosts and spirits may channel Essence through two modes of Work- Numina and Influence. Influence is a direct representation of the kinetic energy of an ephemeral entity- meaning, movement through the world using the same dimension as Essence. By using an Influence, the system actually expands itself, transmitting energy to the environment and preforming work. Influences are always direct representation of the entity's existence, further supporting the claim of them being an action preformed in the Essential Dimension. Numina, on the other hand, is a set of specific functions available to the entity, or specialized forms of Work. The total level of Influence a system has is equal to their Rank value, while the number of Numina is governed by their Rank- meaning that while Influence is movement through constant Essence Numina is movement through constant Rank. It should be noted that ephemeral entities do lose Essence through Influences, but I assume that such lost of energy is done out of Dissipation (see the second law of thermodynamics). Numen generally cost more energy to preform, as they lose both energy to Work and Dissipation, further supporting the claim.<br /> <br /> Finally, before finishing that section of the article, it should be noted that certain non ephemeral beings do have Rank value of their own- Werewolves, for example seem to have spiritual Rank, while certain mediums have a macabre one. That shows that those beings may contain their energy through more than their own, singular dimension, and instead be able to move through other dimensions and effect the corresponding system.<br /> <br /> <b><u>end of section</u></b><br /> <br /> next topic- vampires!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-14T10:45:19-08:00","id":1031675,"title":"","content":"Given that the process of generating any of the distinct kinds of Essence don't usually have observable results in the energetic state of natural phenomena, that is, no energy is lost in the natural system to generate potential energy in the Ephemeral system, it can be considered evidence that lower Rank essence is actually a part of the natural system, or further point to undiscovered sources of energy in the natural system. So, human emotion and memories, as we observe in Spiritual and Macabre Essence systems, are somehow accompanied by energy transformation from unknown sources to potential energy in the form of Essence.<br /> <br /> Also of interest are the characteristics of Essence as matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-14T12:05:25-08:00","id":1031725,"title":"","content":"With the existence of the astral, a realm of thought one could hypothesis that thought has an energy previously undetected. This is supported by the fact that humans, beings with complicated and varied thought are the source of the most quantity and variety of essance. The category of artificial spirits (and potentially conceptual spirits) that only exist in the first place and are sustained because of human actions seems in line with this line of thinking.<br /> <br /> In this sense ghosts too seem the best evidence of this 'thought energy' hypothesis. Their being is seemingly &quot;living&quot; memory with the weakest unable to do anything indipendently. With their existence being provided energy nessisary for them to survive by being remembered by human I feel this is further demonstrated. The question of how an anchor or even the underworld seem to be self sufficient sources of this 'thought energy' is a perplexing anomaly to this theroy.<br /> <br /> Now, I feel that this energy could be harvested if we understood how thought is able to resonate and form into essance. (My individual take on what the 'occult physics' in part the GM uses are)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T16:31:41-08:00","id":1032370,"title":"","content":"Thought could have energy, but it most probably seems to realize Work, instead, with Essence as product of resulting Dispersion. Some unknown sort of energy is involved, but thought is more likely to transform energy than to be it, since, again, there is no discernible lose of energy in the process.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T20:23:09-08:00","id":1032454,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5826_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5826\" data-vbnamecard=\"5826\">monteparnas</a> to give a simple metaphor thought is the stone that is cast. The ripples that result is what is referred to as resonance and essence is the energy within these ripples. When you look at the shadow in a place with a human population compared to a forest no human has lived in beyond a single night it is rather self evident that humanity has a profound effect on the shadow. The simplest explanation is the human mind. After all, look at the many conceptual spirits that can only exist because of human thought.<br /> <br /> Even if thought is nothing more than a catalyst to the coalescence of essence from ambient energy my general point still stands. If one could understand the exact effects one thought or action would have in terms of resonance great works could be achieved.<br /> (The problem with getting into this further is we have no way to measure anything below a whole unit of essence.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T07:56:59-08:00","id":1032662,"title":"","content":"The problem with using the Astral as a base for your theory, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2909_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2909\" data-vbnamecard=\"2909\">Mr.F.I.X.</a> (OOC- you know, all, you could make your own fake personas for this thread!) is that my research as proven that just as both the Shadow and the Underworld utilize a different form of energy (or as certain occultists may say, have a &quot;different flavor of Essence&quot;), the Astral seems to operate on a third form of such energy. I further explore those conclusions on my research of Mages, as those people have the most interactions with the ephemeral beings which call that dimension as their home. That means that while thought itself may be a form of energy, it is not the source for why such thought may &quot;generate Essence&quot; for other spiritual beings. For that reason, I tend to agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5826_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5826\" data-vbnamecard=\"5826\">monteparnas</a>, that the different forms of Essence may exist naturally in the world around us instead of being a manifestation of the mind. For that reason, I have suggested the theory that Essence present the form of energy responsible for the ability to exist- spirits, ghosts and other being of ephemera require Essence simply in order to exist in the world, and as thought perceive such existence in where it does not it creates Work which grants those concepts life of their own, creating conceptual spirits. That similarity to Chemical Potential (which governs how much of a certain material may exist in a system) is what may give Essence its matter-like properties, as monteparnas noticed.<br /> <br /> However, your observation of Essence as being some form of quantum entity such as photons is something that escaped my attention, and I thank you for bringing it up. It may have interesting consequences, such as suggesting an Essential Field which surround us, and in which Essence may gather as the Rank of the universe. Perhaps that field as whole exist as what we know as &quot;Twilight&quot;, hence why we do not notice that energy during standard measurements.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T08:17:52-08:00","id":1032676,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar503_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"503\" data-vbnamecard=\"503\">LostLight</a> ah but do you discount that thought is a variable that must be concidered? Yes there are different wavelengths of essence and beings of essence but the common thread between all of these beings is thought. I admit, it may be nothing more than a catalyst for this proposed &quot;essance field&quot; but I can say without a doubt that it contributes in some form to the process. <br /> <br /> I do admit however my presentation of my theory of thought was flawed. The astra's existence is not the basis of the theroy but a single cornerstone that can serve as a good introduction to my theory. It is a realm of thought with ephemeral beings that are beings of manifested thought within a realm of nothing but thought. From there one can see that thought has more potential to effect our world than our modern instrumentation can detect. The fact that ghosts are sustained by being remembered (thought) and spirits can be born from concepts without physical representation thanks to humanity as well as the measurable effect a humans mental state can have upon the shadow, offers us the potential of a unified ephemeral theroy. Thought I argue is the common thread that binds all ephemeral beings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2909,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","user":"Mr.F.I.X.","date":". 01-16-2017, 11:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T08:47:38-08:00","id":1032690,"title":"","content":"it looks like we are at agreement- for from how I understand your proposal, what you call &quot;thought&quot; I call as &quot;existence&quot;- the process one recognize another's existence is found through the Thought, which may be how one travels through the &quot;dimension of Essence&quot; and reinforce or remove another's existence. Thought, under that paradigm, is the kinetic energy we as human use to move through the Essential Dimensions, or more exactly (as <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5826_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5826\" data-vbnamecard=\"5826\">monteparnas</a> suggested, how we preform Work using Essence. This means that &quot;thought&quot; is how we use &quot;Influences&quot;- only that ephemeral beings, which has much greater Rank value than us, have greater amount of energy of that type and much better control over it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T15:14:52-08:00","id":1032942,"title":"","content":"I have to bring to the light of this discussion two observed phenomena that must be addressed. The first is the state of the Shadow and presence of Spirit-Essence outside human presence. The observation of so-called Nature Spirits produced data that seems to indicate energy being transferred into Essence without Thought. The second is the existence of a &quot;layer&quot; of the Astral that doesn't seems to respond to human Thought, neither.<br /> <br /> Both phenomena indicates that human Thought, present at an analogous location as measured by the four standard space dimensions (erroneously known as space-time), isn't the sole source of Work. Let's observe, though, that several properties of the dynamics of the Shadow's energy system seem to variate under such conditions. I do think it too soon to take Human Thought as the source for an Unified Theory of Essence, but it does seem as a key tool to obtain more data. We still lack controlled data on the subject.<br /> <br /> About the idea of Twilight as a Quantum Field, it made me dare to step outside Thermodynamics for a second: what if the process of generating Essence isn't Work, but the collapse of the Quantum Field? Maybe Essence &quot;without form&quot; is a collection of substances able to exist in macroscopic Quantum Fields, with Thought serving as the Observer Effect, collapsing their wavelength into particular entities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T16:22:51-08:00","id":1032978,"title":"","content":"In response to the aspect of non human influence aspects of the shadow I must put forward that humans are not the sole source of thought but a source of more thought. There have been studies to look into the potential of plants possessing the most basic forms of thought and in a way the presence of their effect upon the shadow could indicate that this has potential merit. There are some inanimate things that are not artifical spirits fed by human thought that are outliers to this theroy I admit but it is possible that by being observed by beings capable of thought they may be established in the shadow. However that is not a certainty.<br /> <br /> In regard to the astral layers that do not respond to human thought I reiterate, humans are not the sole source of thought. <br /> <br /> I do see the merit in your point that follow however.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T06:34:00-08:00","id":1033314,"title":"","content":"From a pure layman's terms aspect: the Shadow is an underlying dimension of reality that captures the resonant frequencies of Work in the physical world, but from this point-of-view Thought can be treated as a form of Work in the physical world. Strong concentrations of astral energy (or the use of magic to give Astral entities Ephemeral forms a la Goetia) could create enough of a disturbance in the physical world to generate Essence in the Shadow. Or perhaps the Shadow is sandwiched between the Physical World and the Astral World in some way where both can affect it. However, it is interesting to note that Shadow Entities have the capacity to think just as humans do, but their thoughts don't directly influence the Shadow unless the entities choose to exert their powers.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also after giving it some thought (no pun intended <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />), I believe the Shadow is mostly influenced by strong or lingering emotional energy. It's not so much how living things think about the world (though thought does play a part in it, especially with Conceptual Spirits) but how they <i>feel</i> about it. <br /> <br /> Huh...now that I'm starting to speculate, it seems to me that Essence is produced by emotion (perhaps it could be argued that even non-living things produce &quot;emotion&quot; in the form of <i>theme</i>, thus the more an inanimate object is interacted with in the physical world, the more theme-resonance it produces which gives it Essence in the Shadow) while the ephemeral form Spirits take on seems to be influenced by thoughts connected with those emotions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5700,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","user":"Nuwisha Nutjob","date":". 01-17-2017, 10:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T12:11:04-08:00","id":1033532,"title":"","content":"As for the subject of thought and Essence, I recommend on <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5700_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5700\" data-vbnamecard=\"5700\">Nuwisha Nutjob</a>'s observation for the difference between emotion and thought. While I have agreed to the concept of thought having the ability to Influence Essence, I have not meant that such process eventually leads to a &quot;Unified Essence Field&quot; theory or anything similar to that. Instead, just as Essence is being divided into different &quot;modes of existence&quot; which represent movement in the corresponding Essential Dimension, I believe that the human mind should also be divided into different &quot;modes of thought&quot;, each representing another form of existence. Such modes of thought should be corresponding to the different Essence types which they represent the form of existence they perceive- macabre Thought (or &quot;memory&quot;), spiritual Thought (&quot;emotion&quot; or &quot;instincts&quot;) and astral Thought (&quot;imagination&quot;/&quot;creativity&quot;). I further wish to add another case study which shows that humans seems to not include all different &quot;modes of Thought&quot; required on preforming Work upon all different Essential Dimension- that is what some call as &quot;angels&quot;. Those beings of ephemera do not regain their Essence (meaning, reinforce their existence) through a direct mode of Thought, but through sacrifice (unless one is to suggest the way they reinforce their existence in such a way is not from the sacrifice itself, but from the willingness of the one preforming the sacrifice to do so, using a mode of Thought called &quot;servitude&quot;).<br /> <br /> While the exploration of the Essential Fields as quantum entities does sound interesting, I have a problem with the ideal of ephemeral beings being the product of the Essential Wave Function Collapsing- for I support the Everett Interpretation over Copenhagen's. After all, different case studies (such as Boston and Seattle) seem to support that interpretation over the more conventional one. Besides, even if you take Copenhagen into account, it looks like ephemeral beings violate certain aspects of the quantum mechanics- such as Zeno Effect, for not only that constant measurement does not stop the passage of time for the system, it actually rise its energy beyond the original energetic level. However, I must admit that I am no expert on quantum mechanics, and if there is such expert he or she is welcomed to add her/his opinion.<br /> <br /> On a related note, while my original intention was to add my study about vampires, I think it would be better to open the subjects for questions from the crowd. Of course, people are more than welcomed to add their opinions over the subject of Essence through thermodynamic (or other) eyes, or present their own studies on the subject of supernatural sciences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}